a.concept(0,'selected_governance','Selected 5.0 Executive/default library','Ordinary framed GTL composition under F02/F03/F04/F07/F09/F10/F17, qualified through S02/S03/S06, including declared cross-branch observation/evaluation and bounded recursive investigation within admitted Program authority.')
a.constraint(0,'governance_selection_release',['selected_governance','release_scope'],'F12/S04 observer/tuner Product/public surfaces remain distinct and reserved, without prohibiting selected ordinary graph governance or removing its proof obligations. No new family is created. 5.0 selection is limited to preregistered graphs; dynamic generation/recomposition/runtime publication is excluded. Future graph construction is ordinary recursive work over GTL primitives whose candidates require publication/validation/admission; it supplies no second language/planner/runtime and this Product assigns it no release.')
