a.constraint(0,'capability_release_matrix',['release_scope'],'5.0 retains declared child/Executive recursion with same HoG, bounds, admitted foldback and parent re-evaluation, including declared cross-branch scope, without child-success-as-parent-completion. Autonomous upstream/out-of-traversal A.0/coordination is 5.1. Existing continuation/restart/recovery/typed stops remain required but yield_continuation production is 5.1. Progress/timeout/interruption/causal events/replay liveness and bounded governance observations remain runtime truth; dedicated observer/tuner drafts/ratification/public surfaces are F12/S04 in 5.1. Generic composition/recursion/attribution/admission/replay remain 5.0; preserve Consensus code/evidence without dedicated complete claim, with standalone F08/S05 agreement/dispute/multi-workspace campaigns in 5.1. Native SDK/CLI independence, one Public authority and worker transport are required; retained adapters remain truthful thin projections, while extra host-adapter work and mandatory Codex/native parity qualify in 5.1.')
a.concept(0,'original_data_mapper','Original Data Mapper evaluation','Separately owned upper-bound capability evaluation of complex, deliberately ambiguous software, probing interpretation, solution/design quality, iteration depth and useful progress under authority/limits; neither ABI 5.0 prerequisite nor an assigned ABI 5.1 feature.')
a.constraint(0,'upper_bound_evaluation_integrity',['original_data_mapper'],'Preserve original ambiguity and do not replace the contract with an easier one after execution. Truthful bounded failure/block may complete evaluation: retain assumptions/interpretations, unmet obligations, realized behavior, attempted revisions/depth and actual stop. Evaluation completion is not application completion or automatic obligation to retry. A separately selected complete-app claim still needs all mandatory outcomes. Generic structural/authority/admission/runtime-truth violations remain Product defects even in demanding cases; successful bounded F17/S06 witness remains required.')
a.concept(0,'installed_witness','F17/S06 selected installed lifecycle witness','Prospectively binds complete original source, exact selected input contract, every selected obligation, prerequisites/dependencies, independent expected-outcome oracle, and each excluded source obligation with downstream owner.')
