a.constraint(0,'progress_with_unresolved_work',['local_consequence','installed_witness'],'Routine work including Data Mapper uses established specification/constraints/admitted authority without routine human approval. Useful declared steel-thread progression may continue carrying unmet obligations only when they do not invalidate next-step prerequisites/authority/hard constraints. Without lawful bounded continuation, return typed block/handoff. Progress neither satisfies gaps nor fabricates prerequisites nor waives closure. Executive applies Consequence recursively through same functions/HoG/ABG; planned F12 adds separately qualified capabilities. Every Worker/Evaluator/Consequence uses a frame defining context/contract/constraints/permitted proposals/return/escalation, not new frame runtime or transferred authority.')
a.constraint(0,'visibility_and_final_authority',['selected_governance','human_boundary'],'Full-tree visibility is indexed replay projections/exact refs plus bounded child investigation/admitted foldback, not the full tree in every prompt. Observation supplies facts, evaluation judgment, Consequence proposes, ABG admits, HoG executes. Wider visibility grants no mutation/reprice/re-entry/closure authority and owner rulings stay reserved. Automatic current-intent continuation, new-action admission, local recursion/correction and fresh replay remain 5.0. Human-response deferral does not defer complete selected witness, self-conformance or actual human acceptance of the same qualified RC; future runtime response differs from release acceptance.')
